        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for EC raid-set geometry",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for EC raid-set geometry\n\nExport lod_ec_data_range_for_parity(), lod_ec_comp_raidset_range(),\nlod_ec_check_data_usable() and lod_ec_shrink_data_geometry() for\ndirect testing.\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/lod_ec_geom_test.c covering the pure raid-set\ngeometry helpers behind EC (erasure coded) layouts, operating on\nplain structs (struct ec_split_comp, struct lod_layout_component)\nwith no dt_object/OST/thandle involved: mapping a parity-component\nstripe index to the raid set of the linked data component it covers\n(lod_ec_data_range_for_parity()), mapping a stripe index of a\ncomponent (data or parity) to the raid-set range within that same\ncomponent (lod_ec_comp_raidset_range()), checking whether a candidate\nOST index is already used by the relevant raid-set window of the\nlinked data component (lod_ec_check_data_usable()), and converting\nesc_k0 raidsets into esc_k1 raidsets to shrink an EC data layout down\nto the number of OSTs actually found (lod_ec_shrink_data_geometry()).\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5\nChange-Id: I29cdd11d6eda767ebdc949294734500b8932b339\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
